# TEMPORARY, until every @behivetech package is on the public npm registry:
# the docs site's chrome (Button, Card, Badge, Table, TextField, EmptyState,
# HeroBanner and the token sheet) installs from GitHub Packages, which needs a
# token with read:packages — `//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=…` in your
# ~/.npmrc, the secret PACKAGES_READ_TOKEN in CI. Delete this line to switch
# the scope back to the public registry; nothing else changes.
@behivetech:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
